 "brief": "MK-029 Main dome, upgraded from MR-002. Matched to the Midjourney pick: a 10 m geodesic dome of triangle panels, mostly off-white hull with a band of dark glass, a few big lower panes glowing warm orange from the living room inside, all held by a dark gunmetal strut frame. It sits on a chunky ring foundation of framed segments with an orange stripe and little status lamps, and a framed entrance tunnel with an arched door frame, an inner hatch and two warm windows. Diegetic: the warm panes dim when everyone is out, and the tunnel lamp goes green when the airlock is ready.",
